        a               sh:PropertyShape ;
        rdfs:label      "P111 added"@en , "Quantification: many to many, necessary (1,n:0,n)\n\nScope note:\nThis property identifies the instance of E18 Physical Thing that is added during an instance of E79 Part Addition activity.\n\nExamples:\n- The insertion of the final nail (E79) added the last nail in George VI’s coffin (E22). (https://www.rct.uk/collection/2000811/the-coffin-of-king-george-vi-during-the-lying-in-state)\n\nIn First Order Logic:\n- P111(x,y) ⇒ E79(x)\n- P111(x,y) ⇒ E18(y)\n- P111(x,y) ⇒ P16(x,y)\n"@en , "P111 增加了"@zh , "P111 adicionou"@pt , "P111 fügte hinzu"@de , "P111 προσέθεσε"@el , "P111 a ajouté"@fr , "P111 добавил"@ru ;
        sh:class        <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E18_Physical_Thing> ;
        sh:description  "Quantification: many to many, necessary (1,n:0,n)\n\nScope note:\nThis property identifies the instance of E18 Physical Thing that is added during an instance of E79 Part Addition activity.\n\nExamples:\n- The insertion of the final nail (E79) added the last nail in George VI’s coffin (E22). (https://www.rct.uk/collection/2000811/the-coffin-of-king-george-vi-during-the-lying-in-state)\n\nIn First Order Logic:\n- P111(x,y) ⇒ E79(x)\n- P111(x,y) ⇒ E18(y)\n- P111(x,y) ⇒ P16(x,y)\n"@en ;
        sh:name         "P111 добавил"@ru , "P111 added"@en , "P111 增加了"@zh , "P111 adicionou"@pt , "P111 fügte hinzu"@de , "P111 προσέθεσε"@el , "P111 a ajouté"@fr ;
