        a               sh:PropertyShape ;
        rdfs:label      "P75 é detentor de"@pt , "Quantification: many to many (0,n:0,n)\n\nScope note:\nThis property associates an instance of E39 Actor to an instance of E30 Right over which the actor holds or has held a legal claim.\n\nExamples:\n- Michael Jackson (E21) possesses intellectual property rights on the Beatles’ back catalogue (E30). (Raga, 2016)\n\nIn First Order Logic:\n- P75(x,y) ⇒ E39(x)\n- P75(x,y) ⇒ E30(y)\n"@en , "P75 besitzt"@de , "P75 possesses"@en , "P75 拥有"@zh , "P75 κατέχει"@el , "P75 possède"@fr , "P75 владeeт"@ru ;
        sh:class        <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E30_Right> ;
        sh:description  "Quantification: many to many (0,n:0,n)\n\nScope note:\nThis property associates an instance of E39 Actor to an instance of E30 Right over which the actor holds or has held a legal claim.\n\nExamples:\n- Michael Jackson (E21) possesses intellectual property rights on the Beatles’ back catalogue (E30). (Raga, 2016)\n\nIn First Order Logic:\n- P75(x,y) ⇒ E39(x)\n- P75(x,y) ⇒ E30(y)\n"@en ;
        sh:name         "P75 владeeт"@ru , "P75 κατέχει"@el , "P75 possède"@fr , "P75 besitzt"@de , "P75 拥有"@zh , "P75 possesses"@en , "P75 é detentor de"@pt ;
