<https://astrea.linkeddata.es/shapes#7278e0623e228269e5c10fd1347b3989>
        a               sh:PropertyShape ;
        rdfs:label      "P45i входит в состав"@ru , "P45i is incorporated in"@en , "P45i 结合在"@zh , "P45i est inclus dans"@fr , "P45i ist enthalten in"@de , "P45i está presente em"@pt , "Quantification of the inverse property: many to many, necessary (1,n:0,n)\n\nScope note of the inverse property:\nThis property identifies the instances of E57 Materials of which an instance of E18 Physical Thing is composed.\nAll physical things consist of physical materials. P45 consists of (is incorporated in) allows the different materials to be recorded. P45 consists of (is incorporated in) refers here to observed material as opposed to the consumed raw material.\nA material, such as a theoretical alloy, may not have any physical instances.\n\nExamples of the inverse property:\n- Silver cup 232 (E22) consists of silver (E57). (fictitious)\n\nIn First Order Logic of the inverse property:\n- P45(x,y) ⇒ E18(x)\n- P45(x,y) ⇒ E57(y)\n"@en , "P45i είναι ενσωματωμένος/η/ο σε"@el ;
        sh:class        <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E18_Physical_Thing> ;
        sh:description  "Quantification of the inverse property: many to many, necessary (1,n:0,n)\n\nScope note of the inverse property:\nThis property identifies the instances of E57 Materials of which an instance of E18 Physical Thing is composed.\nAll physical things consist of physical materials. P45 consists of (is incorporated in) allows the different materials to be recorded. P45 consists of (is incorporated in) refers here to observed material as opposed to the consumed raw material.\nA material, such as a theoretical alloy, may not have any physical instances.\n\nExamples of the inverse property:\n- Silver cup 232 (E22) consists of silver (E57). (fictitious)\n\nIn First Order Logic of the inverse property:\n- P45(x,y) ⇒ E18(x)\n- P45(x,y) ⇒ E57(y)\n"@en ;
        sh:name         "P45i 结合在"@zh , "P45i está presente em"@pt , "P45i est inclus dans"@fr , "P45i входит в состав"@ru , "P45i is incorporated in"@en , "P45i είναι ενσωματωμένος/η/ο σε"@el , "P45i ist enthalten in"@de ;
        sh:nodeKind     sh:BlankNodeOrIRI ;
        sh:path         <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P45i_is_incorporated_in> .

<https://astrea.linkeddata.es/shapes#37c510c41a7e3d10c8a8d5249e3559f1>
        a                 sh:NodeShape ;
