<https://astrea.linkeddata.es/shapes#645e4f0b3dcad2cd375d5b5678ded626>
        a               sh:PropertyShape ;
        rdfs:label      "P140 a assigné l’attribut à"@fr , "P140 atribuiu atributo para"@pt , "P140 assigned attribute to"@en , "P140 получeн атрибут посрeдством"@ru , "P140 分配属性于"@zh , "Quantification: many to many (0,n:0,n)\n\nScope note:\nThis property associates an instance of E13 Attribute Assignment with the instance of E1 CRM Entity about which it made an attribution. The instance of E1 CRM Entity plays the role of the domain of the attribution. \nThe kind of attribution made should be documented using P177 assigned property of type (is type of property assigned).\n\nExamples:\n- The Current Ownership Assessment of Martin Doerr’s silver cup February 1997 (E13) assigned attribute to Martin Doerr’s silver cup (E22). (fictitious)\n- The Identifier Assignment on 1(st) June 1997 of the silver cup donated by Martin Doerr (E15) assigned attribute to silver cup 232 (E22). (fictitious)\n- The examination of MS Sinai Greek 418 (E13) assigned attribute to MS Sinai Greek 418 (E22). (Honey and Pickwoad, 2010)\n\nIn First Order Logic:\n- P140(x,y) ⇒ E13(x)\n- P140(x,y) ⇒ E1(y)\n"@en , "P140 wies Merkmal zu"@de , "P140 απέδωσε ιδιότητα σε"@el ;
        sh:class        <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E1_CRM_Entity> ;
        sh:description  "Quantification: many to many (0,n:0,n)\n\nScope note:\nThis property associates an instance of E13 Attribute Assignment with the instance of E1 CRM Entity about which it made an attribution. The instance of E1 CRM Entity plays the role of the domain of the attribution. \nThe kind of attribution made should be documented using P177 assigned property of type (is type of property assigned).\n\nExamples:\n- The Current Ownership Assessment of Martin Doerr’s silver cup February 1997 (E13) assigned attribute to Martin Doerr’s silver cup (E22). (fictitious)\n- The Identifier Assignment on 1(st) June 1997 of the silver cup donated by Martin Doerr (E15) assigned attribute to silver cup 232 (E22). (fictitious)\n- The examination of MS Sinai Greek 418 (E13) assigned attribute to MS Sinai Greek 418 (E22). (Honey and Pickwoad, 2010)\n\nIn First Order Logic:\n- P140(x,y) ⇒ E13(x)\n- P140(x,y) ⇒ E1(y)\n"@en ;
        sh:name         "P140 wies Merkmal zu"@de , "P140 分配属性于"@zh , "P140 atribuiu atributo para"@pt , "P140 απέδωσε ιδιότητα σε"@el , "P140 получeн атрибут посрeдством"@ru , "P140 assigned attribute to"@en , "P140 a assigné l’attribut à"@fr ;
