        a               sh:PropertyShape ;
        rdfs:label      "P186 a produit la chose du type"@fr , "Quantification: many to many (0,n:0,n)\n\nScope note:\nThis property associates an instance of E12 Production with the instance of E99 Production Type, that is, the type of the things it produces.\n\nExamples:\n- The production activity of the Volkswagen factory related to the “Standard limousine Type II” during 1949-1953 (E12) produced thing of product type Volkswagen Type 11 (Beetle) (E99). (Rieger, 2013)\n\nIn First Order Logic:\n- P186(x,y) ⇒ E12(x)\n- P186(x,y) ⇒ E99(y)\n- P186(x,y) ⇒ (∃z) [E24(z) ∧ P108(x,z) ∧ P2(z,y)]\n"@en , "P186 произвeдeна вeщь типа продукта"@ru , "P186 produced thing of product type"@en ;
        sh:class        <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E99_Product_Type> ;
        sh:description  "Quantification: many to many (0,n:0,n)\n\nScope note:\nThis property associates an instance of E12 Production with the instance of E99 Production Type, that is, the type of the things it produces.\n\nExamples:\n- The production activity of the Volkswagen factory related to the “Standard limousine Type II” during 1949-1953 (E12) produced thing of product type Volkswagen Type 11 (Beetle) (E99). (Rieger, 2013)\n\nIn First Order Logic:\n- P186(x,y) ⇒ E12(x)\n- P186(x,y) ⇒ E99(y)\n- P186(x,y) ⇒ (∃z) [E24(z) ∧ P108(x,z) ∧ P2(z,y)]\n"@en ;
        sh:name         "P186 произвeдeна вeщь типа продукта"@ru , "P186 a produit la chose du type"@fr , "P186 produced thing of product type"@en ;
        sh:nodeKind     sh:BlankNodeOrIRI ;
        sh:path         <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P186_produced_thing_of_product_type> .

