        a               sh:PropertyShape ;
        rdfs:label      "P109 έχει ή είχε επιμελητή"@el , "P109 имeeт дeйствующeго или бывшeго хранитeля"@ru , "P109 tem ou teve curador"@pt , "P109 hat derzeitigen oder früheren Kurator"@de , "P109 a pour responsable actuel ou antérieur de la collection"@fr , "P109 has current or former curator"@en , "P109 有当前或以往管理者"@zh , "Quantification: many to many, necessary (1,n:0,n)\n\nScope note:\nThis property identifies the instance of E39 Actor who assumed or has assumed overall curatorial responsibility for an instance of E78 Curated Holding.\nIt does not allow a history of curation to be recorded. This would require use of an event initiating a curator being responsible for a collection.\n\nExamples:\n- The Robert Opie Collection (E78) has current or former curator Robert Opie (E21). (https://www.robertopiecollection.com/)\n- The Mikael Heggelund Foslie’s coralline red algae Herbarium (E78) has current or former curator Mikael Heggelund Foslie (E21). (Woelkerling et al., 2005)\n\nIn First Order Logic:\n- P109(x,y) ⇒ E78(x)\n- P109(x,y) ⇒ E39(y) \n- P109(x,y) ⇒ P49(x,y)\n"@en ;
        sh:class        <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E39_Actor> ;
        sh:description  "Quantification: many to many, necessary (1,n:0,n)\n\nScope note:\nThis property identifies the instance of E39 Actor who assumed or has assumed overall curatorial responsibility for an instance of E78 Curated Holding.\nIt does not allow a history of curation to be recorded. This would require use of an event initiating a curator being responsible for a collection.\n\nExamples:\n- The Robert Opie Collection (E78) has current or former curator Robert Opie (E21). (https://www.robertopiecollection.com/)\n- The Mikael Heggelund Foslie’s coralline red algae Herbarium (E78) has current or former curator Mikael Heggelund Foslie (E21). (Woelkerling et al., 2005)\n\nIn First Order Logic:\n- P109(x,y) ⇒ E78(x)\n- P109(x,y) ⇒ E39(y) \n- P109(x,y) ⇒ P49(x,y)\n"@en ;
        sh:name         "P109 有当前或以往管理者"@zh , "P109 имeeт дeйствующeго или бывшeго хранитeля"@ru , "P109 has current or former curator"@en , "P109 a pour responsable actuel ou antérieur de la collection"@fr , "P109 tem ou teve curador"@pt , "P109 έχει ή είχε επιμελητή"@el , "P109 hat derzeitigen oder früheren Kurator"@de ;
        sh:nodeKind     sh:BlankNodeOrIRI ;
        sh:path         <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P109_has_current_or_former_curator> .

