<https://astrea.linkeddata.es/shapes#4952a3a33ff6fe2df3b36cd7b656410b>
        a               sh:PropertyShape ;
        rdfs:label      "Quantification of the inverse property: many to one, necessary (1,1:0,n)\n\nScope note of the inverse property:\nThis property records the item to which a type was assigned in an E17 Type Assignment activity.\nAny instance of a CIDOC CRM entity may be assigned a type through type assignment. Type assignment events allow a more detailed path from E1 CRM Entity through P41i was classified by, E17 Type Assignment, P42 assigned, to E55 Type for assigning types to objects compared to the shortcut offered by P2 has type (is type of).\n\nExamples of the inverse property:\n- The classification of silver cup 232 on 31(st) August 1997 (E17) classified silver cup 232 (E22). (fictitious)\n\nIn First Order Logic of the inverse property:\n- P41(x,y) ⇒ E17(x)\n- P41(x,y) ⇒ E1(y) \n- P41(x,y) ⇒ P140(x,y)\n"@en , "P41i a été classifié par"@fr , "P41i wurde klassifiziert durch"@de , "P41i 被分类"@zh , "P41i foi classificada por"@pt , "P41i was classified by"@en , "P41i χαρακτηρίσθηκε από"@el , "P41i был классифицирован"@ru ;
        sh:class        <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E17_Type_Assignment> ;
        sh:description  "Quantification of the inverse property: many to one, necessary (1,1:0,n)\n\nScope note of the inverse property:\nThis property records the item to which a type was assigned in an E17 Type Assignment activity.\nAny instance of a CIDOC CRM entity may be assigned a type through type assignment. Type assignment events allow a more detailed path from E1 CRM Entity through P41i was classified by, E17 Type Assignment, P42 assigned, to E55 Type for assigning types to objects compared to the shortcut offered by P2 has type (is type of).\n\nExamples of the inverse property:\n- The classification of silver cup 232 on 31(st) August 1997 (E17) classified silver cup 232 (E22). (fictitious)\n\nIn First Order Logic of the inverse property:\n- P41(x,y) ⇒ E17(x)\n- P41(x,y) ⇒ E1(y) \n- P41(x,y) ⇒ P140(x,y)\n"@en ;
        sh:name         "P41i a été classifié par"@fr , "P41i foi classificada por"@pt , "P41i был классифицирован"@ru , "P41i 被分类"@zh , "P41i wurde klassifiziert durch"@de , "P41i was classified by"@en , "P41i χαρακτηρίσθηκε από"@el ;
        sh:nodeKind     sh:BlankNodeOrIRI ;
        sh:path         <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P41i_was_classified_by> .

