<https://astrea.linkeddata.es/shapes#8e80309f4e65287ef80386aab4bc4eab>
        a               sh:PropertyShape ;
        rdfs:label      "P109i est responsable actuel ou antérieur de la collection"@fr , "P109i είναι ή ήταν επιμελητής του/της"@el , "P109i ist derzeitiger oder früherer Kurator von"@de , "Quantification of the inverse property: many to many, necessary (1,n:0,n)\n\nScope note of the inverse property:\nThis property identifies the instance of E39 Actor who assumed or has assumed overall curatorial responsibility for an instance of E78 Curated Holding.\nIt does not allow a history of curation to be recorded. This would require use of an event initiating a curator being responsible for a collection.\n\nExamples of the inverse property:\n- The Robert Opie Collection (E78) has current or former curator Robert Opie (E21). (https://www.robertopiecollection.com/)\n- The Mikael Heggelund Foslie’s coralline red algae Herbarium (E78) has current or former curator Mikael Heggelund Foslie (E21). (Woelkerling et al., 2005)\n\nIn First Order Logic of the inverse property:\n- P109(x,y) ⇒ E78(x)\n- P109(x,y) ⇒ E39(y) \n- P109(x,y) ⇒ P49(x,y)\n"@en , "P109i é ou foi curador de"@pt , "P109i 是当前或以往管理者"@zh , "P109i is current or former curator of"@en , "P109i являeтся дeйствующим или бывшим хранитeлeм для"@ru ;
        sh:class        <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E78_Curated_Holding> ;
        sh:description  "Quantification of the inverse property: many to many, necessary (1,n:0,n)\n\nScope note of the inverse property:\nThis property identifies the instance of E39 Actor who assumed or has assumed overall curatorial responsibility for an instance of E78 Curated Holding.\nIt does not allow a history of curation to be recorded. This would require use of an event initiating a curator being responsible for a collection.\n\nExamples of the inverse property:\n- The Robert Opie Collection (E78) has current or former curator Robert Opie (E21). (https://www.robertopiecollection.com/)\n- The Mikael Heggelund Foslie’s coralline red algae Herbarium (E78) has current or former curator Mikael Heggelund Foslie (E21). (Woelkerling et al., 2005)\n\nIn First Order Logic of the inverse property:\n- P109(x,y) ⇒ E78(x)\n- P109(x,y) ⇒ E39(y) \n- P109(x,y) ⇒ P49(x,y)\n"@en ;
        sh:name         "P109i is current or former curator of"@en , "P109i é ou foi curador de"@pt , "P109i являeтся дeйствующим или бывшим хранитeлeм для"@ru , "P109i ist derzeitiger oder früherer Kurator von"@de , "P109i είναι ή ήταν επιμελητής του/της"@el , "P109i 是当前或以往管理者"@zh , "P109i est responsable actuel ou antérieur de la collection"@fr ;
        sh:nodeKind     sh:BlankNodeOrIRI ;
        sh:path         <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P109i_is_current_or_former_curator_of> .

