<https://astrea.linkeddata.es/shapes#2aa32a358db1c41e036dfebec367d8cb>
        a               sh:PropertyShape ;
        rdfs:label      "P22i a acquis le titre de propriété par"@fr , "P22i adquiriu os direitos de propriedade por meio da"@pt , "P22i erwarb Besitztitel durch"@de , "P22i 获得所有权"@zh , "P22i απέκτησε τον τίτλο μέσω"@el , "P22i получил право собствeнности посрeдством"@ru , "Quantification of the inverse property: many to many (0,n:0,n)\n\nScope note of the inverse property:\nThis property identifies the instance of E39 Actor that acquires the legal ownership of an object as a result of an instance of E8 Acquisition. \nThe property will typically describe an Actor purchasing or otherwise acquiring an object from another Actor. However, title may also be acquired without any corresponding loss of title by another Actor, through legal fieldwork such as hunting, shooting, or fishing.\nIn reality, the title is either transferred to or from someone, or both.\n\nExamples of the inverse property:\n- The acquisition of the Amoudruz collection by the Geneva Ethnography Museum (E8) transferred title to the Geneva Ethnography Museum (E74).\n\nIn First Order Logic of the inverse property:\n- P22(x,y) ⇒ E8(x)\n- P22(x,y) ⇒ E39(y) \n- P22(x,y) ⇒ P14(x,y)\n"@en , "P22i acquired title through"@en ;
        sh:class        <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E8_Acquisition> ;
        sh:description  "Quantification of the inverse property: many to many (0,n:0,n)\n\nScope note of the inverse property:\nThis property identifies the instance of E39 Actor that acquires the legal ownership of an object as a result of an instance of E8 Acquisition. \nThe property will typically describe an Actor purchasing or otherwise acquiring an object from another Actor. However, title may also be acquired without any corresponding loss of title by another Actor, through legal fieldwork such as hunting, shooting, or fishing.\nIn reality, the title is either transferred to or from someone, or both.\n\nExamples of the inverse property:\n- The acquisition of the Amoudruz collection by the Geneva Ethnography Museum (E8) transferred title to the Geneva Ethnography Museum (E74).\n\nIn First Order Logic of the inverse property:\n- P22(x,y) ⇒ E8(x)\n- P22(x,y) ⇒ E39(y) \n- P22(x,y) ⇒ P14(x,y)\n"@en ;
        sh:name         "P22i 获得所有权"@zh , "P22i adquiriu os direitos de propriedade por meio da"@pt , "P22i получил право собствeнности посрeдством"@ru , "P22i erwarb Besitztitel durch"@de , "P22i acquired title through"@en , "P22i a acquis le titre de propriété par"@fr , "P22i απέκτησε τον τίτλο μέσω"@el ;
        sh:nodeKind     sh:BlankNodeOrIRI ;
        sh:path         <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P22i_acquired_title_through> .

